    "body": "Merged current main into the branch (`7e39726e`) to clear the review's conflicts. All three were keep-both registration lists: `lib.rs` (`recognize` + `raster`), `mcp/mod.rs` (`pockets` + `render`) and the `mcp/tools.rs` import line. Both tools stay registered in the table. Re-gated on the merge: `pocket_recognition` 10/10, `mcp_pockets` 3/3, `mcp` 13/13, `mcp_render` 5/5, and `clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -D warnings` clean. Re the review's note: the Slot op's own door refuses a cutter wider than the slot (`slot width must exceed the tool diameter`, the typed Slot's validation), and a recognised slot reaches it through the same `CreateOperation`. Stays a draft until it is flagged ready again.",
