    "body": "Correction to my last comment: the cutter-wider-than-slot refusal is at **generation**, not at `CreateOperation`. `machining2d::slots::slot` refuses with \"slot is narrower than the tool\" (`crates/motion/src/machining2d/slots.rs:144`) before any move is made. A recognised slot reaches the same generator, so such an op is created but never generates a path; it is never posted. The quoted message in my previous comment was wrong.",
